  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: GTR+F+ASC+R7:p1,GTR+F+I+R5:p2,GTR+F+R3:p3,TIM2+R5:p4+p5,GTR+F+I+R5:p6

